<p>Hello <%= @resource.first_name %>!</p>

<p>The password for your Edify account (<%= @resource.email %>) was just changed.</p>

<p>If you changed it, there's nothing more to do.</p>

<p>
  If you didn't, someone else may have access to your account.
  <%= link_to "Reset your password", new_password_url(@resource) %> now, then review Settings &gt; API Tokens in Edify
  and revoke any token you don't recognize. Apps connected to your account, such as Claude, were disconnected when the
  password changed.
</p>
